# Forecast OPF Refactoring Plan

5 code quality improvements from the architecture review. Changes are **behavior-preserving** — no functional changes.

## Proposed Changes

### Data Layer

#### [MODIFY] [powergrid_hetero_dataset.py](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/datasets/powergrid_hetero_dataset.py)
- Extract `bus_features`, `gen_features`, `common_branch_features`, `forward_branch_features`, `reverse_branch_features` as **class constants** (`BUS_FEATURES`, `GEN_FEATURES`, etc.)
- Update [process()](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/datasets/powergrid_hetero_dataset.py#64-228) to reference `self.BUS_FEATURES` etc.

#### [MODIFY] [powergrid_hetero_forecast_dataset.py](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/datasets/powergrid_hetero_forecast_dataset.py)
- Remove duplicated feature lists
- Reference parent class constants (`self.BUS_FEATURES`, etc.)

---

### Model Layer

#### [MODIFY] [utils.py](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/models/utils.py)
- Remove empty [PhysicsDecoderForecastOPF](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/models/utils.py#132-135) class
- Register [PhysicsDecoderOPF](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/models/utils.py#82-131) under `"ForecastOPF"` as a direct alias:
```python
PHYSICS_DECODER_REGISTRY._registry["ForecastOPF"] = PhysicsDecoderOPF
```

---

### Task Layer

#### [MODIFY] [opf_task.py](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/opf_task.py)
- Extract physics metrics computation (lines 65–293) into `_compute_opf_metrics(self, output, target, batch, dataset_name, dataloader_idx)` that returns a dict
- Refactor [test_step()](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/forecast_opf_task.py#198-509) to call `_compute_opf_metrics()`

#### [MODIFY] [forecast_opf_task.py](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/forecast_opf_task.py)
1. **Replace magic numbers** with [globals.py](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/datasets/globals.py) constants (`PD_H`, `QD_H`, `QG_H`, `VM_H`, `VA_H`) in [_convert_to_opf_format](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/forecast_opf_task.py#128-167), [_convert_target_to_opf_format](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/forecast_opf_task.py#168-197), and MAE computation
2. **Refactor [test_step()](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/forecast_opf_task.py#198-509)** to:
   - Compute & log forecast MAE metrics
   - Convert to OPF format
   - Call parent's `_compute_opf_metrics()` instead of duplicating ~250 lines
3. **Fix `loss_dict` mutation**: create a separate `test_metrics = {}` dict for test-specific metrics instead of mutating the `loss_dict` from [shared_step()](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/reconstruction_tasks.py#45-62)
4. **Compress MAE logging** into a loop
5. **Update module docstring** (remove stale [shared_step](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/reconstruction_tasks.py#45-62) reference)

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests

Run existing pipeline tests that exercise OPF + PF + SE tasks end-to-end (train → evaluate):
```
cd f:\studium\MA_Code\gridfm-graphkit
..\thesis_env\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest tests/test_pipeline.py -v
```
These configs test [OptimalPowerFlow](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/opf_task.py#48-486), [PowerFlow](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/datasets/task_transforms.py#17-29), [StateEstimation](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/datasets/task_transforms.py#63-77) tasks and will catch regressions in [opf_task.py](file:///f:/studium/MA_Code/gridfm-graphkit/gridfm_graphkit/tasks/opf_task.py).

### Manual Verification

Run the forecasting pipeline with the test config to confirm the full ForecastOPF path works:
```
cd f:\studium\MA_Code\gridfm-graphkit
gridfm_graphkit train --config examples/config/forecasting_test.yaml --data_path data/
```
Expect: training completes with per-component loss logging (`train/Forecast bus MSE`, `train/Forecast gen MSE`, `train/Layered Weighted Physics Loss`).
